1
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:05,767
<font color="white">外星人來襲…</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:09,354
<font color="white">外星人來襲…</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:09,438 --> 00:00:11,898
<font color="white">移動至室內避難…</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:15,026 --> 00:00:16,027
<font color="white">為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:16,111 --> 00:00:18,947
<font color="white">移動至室內避難…</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:49,121 --> 00:01:52,624
<font color="white">-移動至室內避難…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-喂！振作一點！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:55,502 --> 00:01:57,629
<font color="white">來人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:58,630 --> 00:01:59,798
<font color="white">有人受傷了</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:02:05,262 --> 00:02:07,806
<font color="white">這究竟是怎麼一回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:08,348 --> 00:02:11,351
<font color="white">不清楚，需要盡快確認狀況</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:11,434 --> 00:02:12,602
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:28,118 --> 00:02:29,578
<font color="white">還好嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:29,661 --> 00:02:30,787
<font color="white">出了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:31,872 --> 00:02:34,249
<font color="white">為何下手這麼狠？</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:34,332 --> 00:02:37,085
<font color="white">小心！他們說不定會傷害我們</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:40,505 --> 00:02:42,173
<font color="white">如果他們又做出那種事…</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:45,427 --> 00:02:46,678
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:49,306 --> 00:02:52,058
<font color="white">井手先生，我們抵達現場了</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:52,142 --> 00:02:53,602
<font color="white">狀況如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:53,685 --> 00:02:56,354
{\an8}<font color="white">似乎已經有人處理掉阿德羅斯了</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:56,855 --> 00:02:58,481
{\an8}<font color="white">現場有許多傷患</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:59,065 --> 00:03:02,027
<font color="white">看來這不只是阿德羅斯幹的好事</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:04,154 --> 00:03:07,532
{\an8}<font color="white">（救護車）</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:11,286 --> 00:03:13,955
<font color="white">我們也還沒有掌握狀況</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:14,789 --> 00:03:18,251
<font color="white">畢竟因為一年前的那起事件</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:18,335 --> 00:03:21,338
<font color="white">監視器的數量受到限制</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:21,421 --> 00:03:24,174
<font color="white">很難瞭解詳情</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:24,674 --> 00:03:26,927
<font color="white">一般民眾拍攝的影片</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:27,010 --> 00:03:29,596
<font color="white">看來已經在社群媒體上瘋傳了</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:30,513 --> 00:03:32,390
<font color="white">好，播出來看看</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:37,229 --> 00:03:38,980
<font color="white">什麼？這是…</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:39,856 --> 00:03:41,024
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:44,027 --> 00:03:46,446
<font color="white">這到底是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:48,531 --> 00:03:49,991
<font color="white">我想這恐怕是</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:50,533 --> 00:03:54,329
<font color="white">伊多說的“更進一步的覺醒”</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:55,163 --> 00:03:57,999
<font color="white">最糟糕的情況發生了</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:58,708 --> 00:04:01,002
<font color="white">只能那樣理解吧</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:02,462 --> 00:04:05,757
<font color="white">無法否認這個可能性</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:06,508 --> 00:04:10,053
<font color="white">不過我們不能急著下結論</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:12,138 --> 00:04:14,557
<font color="white">就是說啊，冷靜一點，早田</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,601
<font color="white">不然…</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:16,685 --> 00:04:19,271
<font color="white">還有什麼可能性？</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:23,191 --> 00:04:24,234
<font color="white">抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:26,403 --> 00:04:27,570
<font color="white">總而言之</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:28,238 --> 00:04:29,698
<font color="white">我們先聯絡當事人的進次郎吧</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:30,282 --> 00:04:33,785
<font color="white">我從剛才就在嘗試，卻沒有任何回應</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:33,868 --> 00:04:34,786
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:34,869 --> 00:04:36,830
<font color="white">他脫下超人力霸王裝甲了</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:36,913 --> 00:04:38,081
<font color="white">你說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:39,457 --> 00:04:42,502
<font color="white">我們要繼續尋找那小子嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:44,087 --> 00:04:47,090
<font color="white">諸星，你們先回來吧</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:47,173 --> 00:04:48,216
<font color="white">收到</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:51,594 --> 00:04:53,138
<font color="white">早田！</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:53,221 --> 00:04:54,848
<font color="white">等一下，早田</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:55,974 --> 00:04:58,059
<font color="white">我去找進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:59,019 --> 00:05:00,562
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:00,645 --> 00:05:04,691
<font color="white">我以前跟進次郎談過</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:06,526 --> 00:05:09,988
<font color="white">我告訴過他超人力霸王是詛咒</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:11,865 --> 00:05:13,491
<font color="white">那個詛咒</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:14,117 --> 00:05:15,910
<font color="white">現在有了新的意義</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:17,162 --> 00:05:21,374
<font color="white">準備降臨到我們父子身上</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:22,542 --> 00:05:24,961
<font color="white">我有那股強烈的預感</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:26,921 --> 00:05:28,965
<font color="white">讓我去吧，井手</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:44,606 --> 00:05:46,107
<font color="white">怎麼回事啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:50,779 --> 00:05:51,863
<font color="white">話說回來</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:52,363 --> 00:05:54,657
<font color="white">我怎麼會在這種地方？</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:56,993 --> 00:05:59,829
<font color="white">（復興祈願典禮</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">佐山玲奈特別演唱會）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:00,413 --> 00:06:03,917
<font color="white">對了，我必須去典禮會場！</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:10,465 --> 00:06:12,217
<font color="white">發生了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:16,137 --> 00:06:17,555
<font color="white">必須快點聯絡才行</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:21,559 --> 00:06:22,602
<font color="white">不見了</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:28,441 --> 00:06:30,652
<font color="white">已經開始了是嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:31,945 --> 00:06:33,780
<font color="white">那我們得加快腳步</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:36,241 --> 00:06:40,120
<font color="white">包括建設中的大樓在內</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">事發現場有四棟建築物</font></font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:40,203 --> 00:06:42,497
<font color="white">徹底遭到破壞</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:44,457
<font color="white">也有許多人受傷</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:44,541 --> 00:06:47,877
<font color="white">場面依然相當混亂</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:47,961 --> 00:06:49,587
<font color="white">以上是記者在現場的報導</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:49,671 --> 00:06:50,547
<font color="white">（山中慎一郎）</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:51,381 --> 00:06:53,800
<font color="white">有消息指出這起事件的開端</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:53,883 --> 00:06:57,053
<font color="white">是外星人襲擊紀念典禮，進而引發的</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:57,137 --> 00:07:00,223
<font color="white">有人則認為超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">對外星人的攻擊過於激烈</font></font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:00,306 --> 00:07:02,934
<font color="white">才會導致這場慘劇</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:03,017 --> 00:07:05,228
<font color="white">引發部分不滿聲浪</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:05,812 --> 00:07:09,232
<font color="white">因此今天我們將從都市災害學的觀點</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:09,315 --> 00:07:12,652
<font color="white">緊急邀請研究外星人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">以及超人力霸王的專家</font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:12,735 --> 00:07:18,199
<font color="white">帝都大學的大谷正繼教授來到現場</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:18,283 --> 00:07:20,368
<font color="white">大谷教授，麻煩你了</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:20,452 --> 00:07:22,162
<font color="white">請多指教</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:22,245 --> 00:07:25,206
<font color="white">您對這場意外有什麼看法？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:25,290 --> 00:07:26,416
<font color="white">（大谷正繼）</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:26,499 --> 00:07:30,086
<font color="white">這個嘛，比起說是意外</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:30,170 --> 00:07:33,673
<font color="white">我們認為這可以堪稱是一場災難</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:33,756 --> 00:07:35,133
<font color="white">這是我的觀點</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:36,134 --> 00:07:38,887
<font color="white">災害？那是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:38,970 --> 00:07:42,307
<font color="white">-這個嘛，大家可能不知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-妳還好嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,933
<font color="white">-還好</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-從前啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:44,017 --> 00:07:48,480
<font color="white">在巨大超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">擊退怪獸的活躍表現背後</font></font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:48,563 --> 00:07:51,357
<font color="white">其實也造成不少災難</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:51,441 --> 00:07:53,151
<font color="white">而且近幾年來</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:53,902 --> 00:07:57,739
<font color="white">確實常發生外星人相關的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:59,073 --> 00:08:04,996
<font color="white">我清楚新的超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">確實有成功解決許多事件的實績</font></font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,122
<font color="white">可是呢</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:06,206 --> 00:08:11,252
<font color="white">他們像過去一樣帶來了損害</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:11,336 --> 00:08:13,296
<font color="white">我們不能忽視這一點</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:13,379 --> 00:08:18,009
<font color="white">儘管超人力霸王解決了外星人的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:18,092 --> 00:08:20,595
<font color="white">對於他們持續釀成的災難</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:20,678 --> 00:08:23,306
<font color="white">我們可以繼續視而不見嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:24,265 --> 00:08:26,184
<font color="white">這次發生的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:26,267 --> 00:08:29,395
<font color="white">正是我們過去長期忽略的問題</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:29,479 --> 00:08:34,692
<font color="white">變得更嚴重，進而浮出檯面</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:08:36,152 --> 00:08:37,403
<font color="white">這是…</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:08:38,029 --> 00:08:40,114
<font color="white">我做的事嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:08:40,907 --> 00:08:42,075
<font color="white">不對…</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:08:43,576 --> 00:08:45,245
<font color="white">那是不可能的</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:46,454 --> 00:08:49,290
<font color="white">超人力霸王其實很危險吧</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:49,374 --> 00:08:53,044
<font color="white">話說超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">以為自己很了不起嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:03,972
<font color="white">（淡谷又成為災區了嗎？）</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:04,055 --> 00:09:06,057
<font color="white">（科學特搜隊有太多權力</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">根本能與國家軍隊匹敵）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:09,352
<font color="white">在這種情況下總會有人出來大驚小怪</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:09,978 --> 00:09:11,104
<font color="white">別放在心上</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:12,188 --> 00:09:14,941
<font color="white">我沒有放在心上，不過…</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:18,945 --> 00:09:19,988
<font color="white">打擾了</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:22,282 --> 00:09:23,741
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:25,285 --> 00:09:27,120
<font color="white">我回來了</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:09:28,329 --> 00:09:31,541
<font color="white">進次郎，你為什麼要做出那種事？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:09:33,501 --> 00:09:35,128
<font color="white">-我沒做</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:09:36,129 --> 00:09:38,339
<font color="white">我什麼都沒做！</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:09:38,423 --> 00:09:39,757
<font color="white">不然那到底是怎麼…</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:09:40,842 --> 00:09:41,968
<font color="white">你冷靜一點</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,846
<font color="white">對不起</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:46,556 --> 00:09:50,226
<font color="white">進次郎，當時發生了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:09:51,811 --> 00:09:54,564
<font color="white">我完全不記得了</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:09:55,607 --> 00:09:56,858
<font color="white">全都不記得？</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:09:58,067 --> 00:09:59,986
<font color="white">爸聯絡我後</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:00,612 --> 00:10:03,531
<font color="white">我立刻打算前往典禮會場</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:04,991 --> 00:10:07,577
<font color="white">但沒有後續的記憶</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:08,202 --> 00:10:11,372
<font color="white">回過神後，我就倒在大樓旁的巷子裡</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:12,498 --> 00:10:16,044
<font color="white">在當下就已經是那副慘狀了</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:16,878 --> 00:10:21,132
<font color="white">不管怎樣，我們現在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">只能盡快確認事情的原委了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:22,258 --> 00:10:25,136
<font color="white">如果你想起任何事，立刻告訴我</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:26,137 --> 00:10:27,263
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:29,432 --> 00:10:30,767
<font color="white">另外啊</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:31,893 --> 00:10:37,440
<font color="white">我要暫時禁止你使用裝甲</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:38,524 --> 00:10:39,942
<font color="white">也不能出動</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,572
<font color="white">那你的意思是…</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:10:47,867 --> 00:10:48,951
<font color="white">井手先生…</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:54,040
<font color="white">科學特搜隊認為是我做出這些事嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:10:54,123 --> 00:10:57,794
<font color="white">很遺憾，不僅僅是那段影片</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:10:58,419 --> 00:11:00,254
<font color="white">裝甲的操作數據</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:04,717
<font color="white">也顯示出你穿著裝甲出現在事發現場</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:06,010 --> 00:11:07,595
<font color="white">不是我做的</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:08,721 --> 00:11:10,390
<font color="white">雖然我說過自己不記得</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:11,641 --> 00:11:13,434
<font color="white">可是真的不是我幹的</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:13,518 --> 00:11:15,353
<font color="white">我至少清楚那一點</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:15,436 --> 00:11:17,271
<font color="white">你一點也不懂</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:20,608 --> 00:11:22,693
<font color="white">為了讓你的那個主張成立</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:22,777 --> 00:11:25,488
<font color="white">我們只能想辦法證明</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你不是那位罪魁禍首</font></font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:26,030 --> 00:11:30,034
<font color="white">不過就整體狀況來看</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那只可能是進次郎…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:30,118 --> 00:11:31,160
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:31,661 --> 00:11:35,665
<font color="white">但數據終究只是數據</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:36,749 --> 00:11:38,126
<font color="white">也可以這麼說吧</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:41,295 --> 00:11:45,091
<font color="white">我們現在只能設法驗證各種可能性了</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:48,636 --> 00:11:50,096
<font color="white">你能理解吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,106
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:12:01,732 --> 00:12:02,692
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:12:03,484 --> 00:12:06,863
<font color="white">我剛剛說得太過分了，對不起</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:08,781
<font color="white">沒關係</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:10,032 --> 00:12:11,701
<font color="white">這是井手先生給你的</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:12,285 --> 00:12:13,828
<font color="white">你把手機弄丟了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:14,412 --> 00:12:16,497
<font color="white">他要你暫時先用這台手機</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:18,124 --> 00:12:19,167
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:21,085 --> 00:12:23,963
<font color="white">太郎先生也在懷疑我嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:31,971 --> 00:12:34,474
<font color="white">老實說，我不確定</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:39,187
<font color="white">但我們一定能揭開真相</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,563
<font color="white">我相信辦得到</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:12:41,230 --> 00:12:44,233
<font color="white">你也要相信自己</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:46,402 --> 00:12:47,403
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:48,070 --> 00:12:50,031
<font color="white">-再見</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那個…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:12:50,114 --> 00:12:51,616
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:12:51,699 --> 00:12:56,496
<font color="white">那個，你不知道我爸的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">聯絡方式對吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:12:56,579 --> 00:12:59,582
<font color="white">對喔，那台手機可能還沒有資料</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:12:59,665 --> 00:13:02,168
<font color="white">好，我知道後會馬上聯絡你的</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:02,668 --> 00:13:04,045
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:11,761 --> 00:13:13,012
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:13,596 --> 00:13:15,056
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:15,139 --> 00:13:16,933
<font color="white">很抱歉，井手</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:13:33,908 --> 00:13:34,909
<font color="white">喂？</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:13:35,993 --> 00:13:36,953
<font color="white">爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:13:37,662 --> 00:13:38,955
<font color="white">是進次郎嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:13:39,539 --> 00:13:40,373
<font color="white">對</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:13:41,290 --> 00:13:43,751
<font color="white">井手剛剛打給我了</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:13:44,335 --> 00:13:46,587
<font color="white">我從他那裡聽說大致的狀況了</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:13:46,671 --> 00:13:48,047
<font color="white">發生了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:13:50,132 --> 00:13:51,884
<font color="white">算了，你現在不必告訴我</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:13:53,594 --> 00:13:54,804
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:13:55,555 --> 00:13:59,267
<font color="white">你現在還保留著以前</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">身為超人力霸王時的記憶嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:14:02,061 --> 00:14:03,938
<font color="white">我也不清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:14:04,021 --> 00:14:05,982
<font color="white">雖然只是片段的記憶</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:14:06,065 --> 00:14:09,527
<font color="white">應該說我多多少少都還記得</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:14:11,362 --> 00:14:15,032
<font color="white">代表你腦中有來源不明的記憶嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:14:17,535 --> 00:14:20,955
<font color="white">進次郎，你現在在哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:14:23,583 --> 00:14:25,209
<font color="white">我正打算回家</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:14:26,043 --> 00:14:30,006
<font color="white">我們久違地好好聊一聊吧</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:14:30,089 --> 00:14:32,675
<font color="white">我也正要回家</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:14:32,758 --> 00:14:34,510
<font color="white">不能在家聊啦</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:14:35,136 --> 00:14:37,179
<font color="white">會害媽擔心的</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:14:38,055 --> 00:14:39,515
<font color="white">說得也是</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:14:39,599 --> 00:14:42,935
<font color="white">我也不想被你媽責罵</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:14:43,019 --> 00:14:44,020
<font color="white">我想也是</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:14:45,563 --> 00:14:49,150
<font color="white">不如我們去並木公園如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:14:49,233 --> 00:14:51,277
<font color="white">知道了，我立刻過去</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:15:25,019 --> 00:15:26,354
<font color="white">真有一套</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:15:26,938 --> 00:15:29,982
<font color="white">不愧是前光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:15:30,066 --> 00:15:32,860
<font color="white">你是什麼人？</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:15:33,861 --> 00:15:36,113
<font color="white">無名受害人</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:15:38,532 --> 00:15:42,828
<font color="white">我就自稱是其發言人吧</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:16:09,730 --> 00:16:10,898
<font color="white">他很強</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:16:14,485 --> 00:16:15,611
<font color="white">這次又怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:16:16,195 --> 00:16:18,072
<font color="white">佐菲裝甲被傳送了</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:16:18,823 --> 00:16:19,991
<font color="white">妳說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:16:20,074 --> 00:16:22,535
<font color="white">-這是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-立刻確認位置</font></font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:16:22,618 --> 00:16:26,288
<font color="white">確認到能量反應</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他似乎正在與某人交戰</font></font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:16:28,249 --> 00:16:29,333
<font color="white">早田嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:16:47,685 --> 00:16:51,647
<font color="white">你襲擊我的目的究竟是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:16:51,731 --> 00:16:52,815
<font color="white">回答我！</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:17:01,741 --> 00:17:03,034
<font color="white">真了不起</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:17:05,786 --> 00:17:07,246
<font color="white">你的那股力量</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:17:07,872 --> 00:17:10,583
<font color="white">看來完全沒有衰退呢</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:17:12,043 --> 00:17:13,210
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:17:14,128 --> 00:17:16,547
<font color="white">那不是超人力霸王嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:17:17,173 --> 00:17:18,591
<font color="white">不能在這裡戰鬥</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:17:28,309 --> 00:17:29,435
<font color="white">原來如此</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:17:30,644 --> 00:17:33,064
<font color="white">你不能繼續</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:17:33,647 --> 00:17:36,525
<font color="white">破壞超人力霸王的名聲</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:17:38,027 --> 00:17:39,695
<font color="white">是這樣沒錯吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:18:24,949 --> 00:18:28,494
<font color="white">（並木公園）</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:18:31,914 --> 00:18:33,040
<font color="white">怪了</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:18:33,624 --> 00:18:35,876
<font color="white">我比爸還早到嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:18:36,961 --> 00:18:40,131
<font color="white">科學特搜隊直升機102號，緊急出動</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:18:40,798 --> 00:18:44,176
<font color="white">科學特搜隊直升機102號，緊急出動</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:18:46,095 --> 00:18:47,263
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:18:47,805 --> 00:18:49,849
<font color="white">這次又出了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:18:49,932 --> 00:18:52,893
<font color="white">早田先生似乎正在跟某人交戰</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:18:52,977 --> 00:18:55,146
<font color="white">我們要去確認狀況</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:18:55,229 --> 00:18:56,897
<font color="white">-早田先生嗎？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎麼了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:18:57,857 --> 00:19:00,151
<font color="white">沒事，進次郎呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:19:00,234 --> 00:19:02,528
<font color="white">那小子現在幫不上任何忙</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:04,572
<font color="white">告訴他也沒用</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:19:44,653 --> 00:19:45,779
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:19:56,248 --> 00:20:01,253
<font color="white">像這樣隱密地戰鬥也不賴吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:20:02,546 --> 00:20:04,798
<font color="white">真符合你的風格</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:20:05,424 --> 00:20:06,508
<font color="white">不過…</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:20:09,511 --> 00:20:10,763
<font color="white">對了</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:20:11,472 --> 00:20:14,642
<font color="white">我想到一件劇本中沒有寫的事</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:20:18,646 --> 00:20:23,442
<font color="white">若英雄無法向大眾</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">展現大顯身手的模樣</font></font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:20:25,027 --> 00:20:28,113
<font color="white">就絲毫沒有存在的必要</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:20:28,656 --> 00:20:31,116
<font color="white">你不這麼認為嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:20:31,784 --> 00:20:33,118
<font color="white">你在說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:20:37,539 --> 00:20:38,874
<font color="white">那是什麼啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:20:41,585 --> 00:20:42,586
<font color="white">給我住手！</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:20:58,852 --> 00:21:00,479
<font color="white">真是了不起</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:21:01,063 --> 00:21:03,190
<font color="white">像你這樣的人</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:21:03,274 --> 00:21:06,235
<font color="white">一定願意保護民眾的性命</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:21:07,528 --> 00:21:09,154
<font color="white">我早就料到了</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:21:15,494 --> 00:21:16,578
<font color="white">那是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:21:17,955 --> 00:21:20,749
<font color="white">你到底有什麼目的？</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:21:21,417 --> 00:21:24,837
<font color="white">是時候結束這一切了</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:37,766
<font color="white">爸！</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:22:03,542 --> 00:22:06,712
<font color="white">佐菲裝甲斷線了</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:22:06,795 --> 00:22:08,130
<font color="white">早田！</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：劉哲琪</font><font color="white"></font>

